### S-6: ladder_bridge.py (~100 lines)

1. `LadderBridge` class:
   - `__init__(ladder_runner_path, route_key=None)`
   - `should_escalate(search_results) -> bool` — detect SEO saturation
   - `run_ladder(topic, route_key) -> list[MicroQueryResult]`
