2. SEO saturation detection (`should_escalate`):
   - Count results matching blog/SEO patterns (listicle titles, affiliate URLs)
   - If >= 60% of top results are SEO-polluted → escalate
   - Patterns: "top N", "best X for", "how to", ".com/blog/", affiliate params

3. Route auto-detection from query context:
